  "details": "Possibly related to https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1137-utilitiesisvalid-crashes-when-checking-destroyed-objects (which seems to have been fixed?).\nHaving a reference to a destroyed component inside an array prevents the array from being accessed from other components. \nSetup I used to test this:\nThree objects in the scene, each with one of the three components.\nUsing the editor, CrasheeHolder holds one Crashee inside its array.\nCrasher contains a reference to CrasheeHolder.\nCode:\nhttps://pastebin.com/hTRcmfGq",
